    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 03 进阶技�?
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 3.1 Few-Shot Learning\n",
    "\n",
    "�?Prompt 中提供若干输�?输出示例，让模型模仿模式。\n",
    "\n",
    "```\n",
    "Text: (lawrence bounces) all over the stage, dancing...\n",
    "Sentiment: positive\n",
    "\n",
    "Text: despite all evidence to the contrary, this clunker...\n",
    "Sentiment: negative\n",
    "\n",
    "Text: i'll bet the video game is a lot more fun than the film.\n",
    "Sentiment:\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 3.2 Chain-of-Thought（链式思考）\n",
    "\n",
    "要求模型展示逐步推理过程，显著提升数学、逻辑、代码任务准确率。\n",
    "\n",
    "**Zero-shot CoT 模板**：\n",
    "```\n",
    "Question: {复杂问题}\n",
    "Answer: Let's think step by step.\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Few-shot CoT 模板**：\n",
    "```\n",
    "Question: {问题}\n",
    "Answer: 推理步骤 1...\n",
    "推理步骤 2...\n",
    "所以答案是：{答案}\n",
    "===\n",
    "Question: {新问题}\n",
    "Answer:\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 3.3 Tree of Thoughts（思维树）\n",
    "\n",
    "在每一步生成多个候选思路，形成树结构，用 BFS/DFS 搜索最优路径。\n",
    "\n",
    "适用场景：复杂规划、数学证明、创意写作�?
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 3.4 ReAct（推�?+ 行动）\n",
    "\n",
    "交替进行思考（Thought）和工具调用（Action），将推理过程显式化。\n",
    "\n",
    "```\n",
    "Thought: 我需要查一下当前北京的天气。\n",
    "Action: WeatherAPI(\"Beijing\")\n",
    "Observation: 15°C，晴\n",
    "Thought: 用户问的是穿衣建议，我需要基于温度给出推荐。\n",
    "Answer: 建议穿薄外套...\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 3.5 RAG（检索增强生成）\n",
    "\n",
    "```\n",
    "1. 用户提问\n",
    "2. 检索系统从知识库找出最相关�?Top-K 文档片段\n",
    "3. 将片段作�?Context 注入 Prompt\n",
    "4. 模型生成基于检索内容的答案\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**格式建议**：\n",
    "```\n",
    "Evidence: {检索到的段落}\n",
    "Question: {用户问题}\n",
    "Answer:\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 3.6 Agent 工作流模�?
   ]
